 "notes": {
  "7811:5572": "bare word 'round': the tennis balls are round and fill the screen",
  "475:5957": "memory is a core psychology topic; a learner could link the two",
  "5409:1610": "face close-up, her nose is plainly visible on screen",
  "4196:1469": "bare word 'iron' also names the metal; the grey metal bucket is the central object",
  "4537:129": "she wipes a table with a cloth; cloth on a table could be read as tablecloth",
  "7054:4913": "ironed shirts hang outdoors on hangers from the umbrella, which looks like airing out",
  "7054:3426": "beachgoers sunbathing and floating on rings are visibly resting",
  "5371:2033": "the women set a pole upright in the ground; 'plant a pole' is arguable, and the pole is covered in plants",
  "879:2747": "the wolf walks at an unhurried pace toward the camera; 'slow' is arguable",
  "4851:1769": "bare word 'ruler': the colossal pharaoh's head shows a ruler",
  "597:6059": "bare word 'club': a tennis court is commonly a tennis club; also near 'racket' as a thing you hit a ball with",
  "4011:2640": "the puppy plays a piece (of music) for its audience"
 }
}